Most Important Git Commands – Quick Revision Sheet
These are the commands I recommend memorizing first.
Priority	Command	Remember it as
1	git init	Start Git
2	git clone	Download project
3	git status	Check changes
4	git add .	Select changes
5	git commit -m	Save snapshot
6	git log --oneline	View history
7	git remote -v	Check connection
8	git push	Upload
9	git pull	Download + integrate
10	git fetch	Download updates
11	git branch	Manage branches
12	git switch -c	Create branch
13	git merge	Combine branches
14	git stash	Temporarily save work
15	git revert	Undo a commit safely
